# 1. Calibration
# THIS CALIBRATION CALIBRATES TO AVERAGES OVER THE WHOLE LIFE-CYCLE
Calibration with the default settings. Running the file as a script produces the same log and archives it in `calibration_results/` automatically.
Parameter override calib = CalibrationParams(inner_xtol = 1e-7) and lambdaMin = 1e-6 needed to ensure convergence of the calibration search: the default lambdaMin=0.2 was not sufficient (The calibration searches qSav over [0.900, 1.040]. At the lower end, qSav = 0.900 is an 11.1% return on saving, and compounded over 100 periods that gives enormous assets — so the budget-clearing λ collapses to 0.059, below lambdaMin = 0.20.)

 
julia --project=. -t 5
include("calibrate_history_independent_tax.jl")
result_calib = calibrate_history_independent_tax_oneprice(
           nZ=15, nEps=11, nKappa=5, nA=151,
           calib = OnePriceCalibration(inner_xtol = 1e-7),
           lambdaMin = 1e-6)

